1
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:36,500
My weight shift late in second turn.

2
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:40,500
He says I hang in every pause.

3
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,500
Just follow me to make it clean.

4
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:48,500
He lectures me with stupid laws.

5
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,500
You dance just like a broomstick, Mark.

6
00:00:58,500 --> 00:01:01,500
No drop of blood inside your frame.

7
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:05,500
Stop counting numbers in my ear.

8
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:09,500
I'm sick and tired of your game.

9
00:01:11,500 --> 00:01:14,500
He snaps and calls my passion cheap.

10
00:01:15,500 --> 00:01:18,500
You're selling sex, you sell no dance.

11
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:22,500
He masks his fear with bitter hate.

12
00:01:23,500 --> 00:01:26,500
And doesn't give a second glance.

13
00:01:28,500 --> 00:01:31,500
Pack up your bags and leave right now.

14
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:35,500
We're finished here, we're done today.

15
00:01:36,500 --> 00:01:39,500
You're terrified of music, Mark.

16
00:01:40,500 --> 00:01:43,500
Get off the floor and walk away.

17
00:01:54,680 --> 00:01:57,680
He stands there pale and quiet now.

18
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:01,680
Speechless right beside the door.

19
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,680
I will not let him crush my soul.

20
00:02:06,680 --> 00:02:09,680
Upon this shiny wooden floor.

21
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:13,680
Another partner walks away.

22
00:02:14,680 --> 00:02:17,680
Left alone beside the floor.

23
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:21,680
I'm tired of fighting another day,

24
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:25,680
I cannot do this anymore…

25
00:02:36,860 --> 00:02:39,860
I saw the heavy door slam shut.

26
00:02:41,860 --> 00:02:46,860
Ginger, drink this warm porcelain tea.

27
00:02:49,860 --> 00:02:52,860
Stop looking for a golden pin,

28
00:02:55,860 --> 00:02:58,860
On a suit you want to see.

29
00:03:01,860 --> 00:03:04,860
Fire isn't taught in books,

30
00:03:06,860 --> 00:03:09,860
Nor on a shiny badge.

31
00:03:14,860 --> 00:03:17,860
You look in all the wrong places,

32
00:03:19,860 --> 00:03:22,860
Standing right on the edge.

33
00:03:31,860 --> 00:03:34,860
Look at the empty chair right here.

34
00:03:37,860 --> 00:03:40,860
Paul sat where you sit right now.

35
00:03:43,860 --> 00:03:46,860
He doesn't want to rule your heart,

36
00:03:49,860 --> 00:03:52,860
Or make your spirit bow.

37
00:03:55,860 --> 00:03:58,860
He doesn't want to tame your soul,

38
00:04:01,860 --> 00:04:04,860
Or pull you down with pride.

39
00:04:07,860 --> 00:04:10,860
He wants to stand inside your fire,

40
00:04:13,860 --> 00:04:16,860
And feel it burn by your side.

41
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:22,860
You laugh and ask if I am mad,

42
00:04:25,860 --> 00:04:28,860
That boy who stutters on his keys?

43
00:04:31,860 --> 00:04:34,860
I say he looked at you with awe,

44
00:04:37,860 --> 00:04:40,860
Not looking for a prize to seize.

45
00:04:43,860 --> 00:04:46,860
Drink your tea, my weary child.

46
00:04:49,860 --> 00:04:52,860
Let the cold anger part.

47
00:04:55,860 --> 00:04:58,860
True fire isn't taught in books...

48
00:05:01,860 --> 00:05:04,860
It starts inside a true heart.